# Build context for scripts/worker/Dockerfile.
#
# Without this the context is ~330 MB — node_modules, dist/, the 38 MiB NNUE net
# staged into public/stockfish/, and ~18 MB of puzzle shards — none of which the
# Dockerfile COPYs. It costs little locally but is a real upload when the image is
# built by Cloud Build or pushed from a laptop, and a fat context slows every
# rebuild.
#
# The Dockerfile only needs: package*.json, tsconfig*.json, src/, scripts/.

node_modules
dist
dist-worker
dist-extension
.git
.github
.cache
.vite
.cursor

# public/ is not COPYd at all: the worker uses a native Stockfish binary with the
# net embedded, so it needs neither the staged .nnue nor the puzzle corpus.
public

# Secrets and local config must never enter an image layer.
.env
.env.*
worker.env
.env.worker

# Docs, tests fixtures and screenshots the worker image has no use for.
*.md
!scripts/worker/README.md
extension-test-*.png
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
